19a03f9e475c664f7b2685231d9e9","_from":".","_npmVersion":"3.10.8","_nodeVersion":"6.9.1","_npmUser":{"name":"benweet","email":"benoit.schweblin@gmail.com"},"dist":{"shasum":"ae2b4f4c5c719a03f9e475c664f7b2685231d9e9","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/markdown-it-mathjax/-/markdown-it-mathjax-2.0.0.tgz","integrity":"sha512-Fafv7TnMENccWYTNjMZzV4BzONPxpK9Mknr1iMEK6m7PI5a5UTCOFctPzx7Nhv81fFzYEY8WHDkSu9n43fTV9g==","signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEYCIQDCnK9hqloivoqpPWuMnEygrIuInK+3jV0JE51l5XTNNgIhAPEdaDFzF7ZIcPPkjHtPQFD+IQIys8jaHSVqi/83fzip"}]},"maintainers":[{"name":"benweet","email":"benoit.schweblin@gmail.com"}],"_npmOperationalInternal":{"host":"packages-18-east.internal.npmjs.com","tmp":"tmp/markdown-it-mathjax-2.0.0.tgz_1480872999985_0.9807245715055615"}}},"readme":"# markdown-it-mathjax\n\n[![Build Status](https://img.shields.io/travis/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax/master.svg?style=flat)](https://travis-ci.org/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax)\n[![NPM version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/markdown-it-mathjax.svg?style=flat)](https://www.npmjs.org/package/markdown-it-mathjax)\n\n> [Markdown-it](https://github.com/markdown-it/markdown-it) plugin to bypass LaTeX math for mathjax processing.\n\nProcesses TeX displayed math\n\n`$$1 *2* 3$$` => `\\[1 *2* 3\\]`\n\nProcesses TeX in-line math\n\n`$1 *2* 3$` => `\\(1 *2* 3\\)`\n\nSkips in-line math if numbers are around (according to [pandoc math](http://pandoc.org/README.html#math))\n\n`$1 *2* 3$5` => `$1 <em>2</em> 3$5`\n\nAlso processes LaTeX delimiters (double backslashed)\n\n`\\\\(1 *2* 3\\\\)` => `\\(1 *2* 3\\)`\n\n`\\\\[1 *2* 3\\\\]` => `\\[1 *2* 3\\]`\n\nAnd sections\n\n`\\begin{abc}1 *2* 3\\end{abc}` => `\\begin{abc}1 *2* 3\\end{abc}`\n\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install markdown-it-mathjax --save\n```\n\n## Use\n\n```js\nvar md = require('markdown-it')()\n            .use(require('markdown-it-mathjax')());\n\nmd.render('$1 *2* 3$') // => '<p>\\(1 *2* 3\\)</p>'\n```\n\n_Differences in browser._ If you load script directly into the page, without\npackage system, module will add itself globally as `window.markdownitMathjax`.\n\n\n## License\n\n[MIT](https://github.com/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax/blob/master/LICENSE)\n","maintainers":[{"name":"benweet","email":"benoit.schweblin@gmail.com"}],"time":{"modified":"2022-06-19T16:08:48.340Z","created":"2015-12-12T14:11:57.627Z","1.0.0":"2015-12-12T14:11:57.627Z","1.0.1":"2015-12-12T16:49:09.663Z","1.0.2":"2015-12-12T16:59:21.010Z","1.0.3":"2016-03-13T17:43:17.777Z","2.0.0":"2016-12-04T17:36:40.592Z"},"homepage":"https://github.com/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax#readme","repository":{"type":"git","url":"git+https://github.com/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax.git"},"author":{"name":"Benoit Schweblin"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/classeur/markdown-it-mathjax/issues"},"license":"ISC","readmeFilename":"README.md"}